Cat Clip Composer 0.1.29

- Selects the newest overlapping timeline effect and supports full effect copy/paste at the playhead.
- Saves text overlay presets with generated text/font thumbnails.
- Adds Project Preview wheel zoom, timeline wheel panning, and modifier-aware time steps.
- Marks library clips as current-project, other-project, or new/unseen with durable corner badges.
- Sorts the Content Browser by name, newest date, length, or custom tag.
